{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Calculate the Dysphonia Severity Index (DSI). DSI > 1.6 = normal voice; DSI < \u20131.6 = severe dysphonia. Requires a sustained vowel WAV file plus voice-range parameters (MPT, F0 range, minimum intensity). BEFORE CALLING: Confirm the user has a sustained vowel recording (/a/ held at comfortable pitch for 3+ s, minimal background noise). If not, explain what it is and ask them to record one. Do not pass connected speech or conversational audio.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"maximumF0":{"description":"Highest fundamental frequency in Hz","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"minimumIntensity":{"description":"Softest intensity in dB SPL","type":"number"},"mpt":{"description":"Maximum Phonation Time in seconds","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"patientAge":{"description":"Speaker age in years (0\u2013120)","maximum":120,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"patientGender":{"description":"Speaker gender: 1 = Male, 2 = Female, 3 = Other","enum":["1","2","3"],"type":"string"},"sustainedVowelPath":{"description":"Sustained vowel WAV file","type":"string"},"version":{"default":"v01","description":"Algorithm version (default: 'v01')","type":"string"}},"required":["sustainedVowelPath","mpt","maximumF0","minimumIntensity","patientAge","patientGender"],"type":"object"},"name":"vocametrix_calculate_dsi","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"result":{}},"type":"object"}}
